data: {"id": "dcca0d8e7b434c50-final", "run_id": "dcca0d8e7b434c50", "seq": 1127, "ts_ms": 1789077045615, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod容器启动时因检测到应用配置缺失(CONFIG_MISSING)，主动抛出500错误并以退出码78终止进程。由于关键配置缺失问题未得到修正，Kubernetes反复重启容器并进入CrashLoopBackOff状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` | `BackOff  4m34s (x332 over 79m)` (fact-780104c50c0a) | 确认容器处于持续的 BackOff 重启循环中 |\n| 2 | K8s State | K8s API | `waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff`, `last_terminated_reason: Error`, `exit_code: 78` (fact-b433a5a40519, fact-9cce0d23013e, fact-202ab42b0935) | 描述当前终止的具体状态与异常退出码 |\n| 3 | Logging | `elasticsearch` | `event: http_request`, `level: error`, `message: CONFIG_MISSING`, `http_status: 500` (pattern repeated 8 times, fact-50b4402484fb) | 直接证实应用因配置缺失主动返回 500 错误 |\n| 4 | Tracing | `tempo` | `span_id: 87f4788bf565213d`, `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit`, `http.response.status_code: 500` (fact-04acb98e6dbc) | 独立观测维度验证了 500 状态码与 `config_missing_exit` 机制 |\n\n上述证据形成闭环：K8s 记录的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态与 `exit_code=78`（证据2）与日志中捕获的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误（证据3）完全吻合。Tracing 数据（证据4）进一步独立证实了应用是在检测到配置缺失后主动返回 500 并退出的。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用启动时检测到必需配置项缺失 → 应用程序记录CONFIG_MISSING错误并返回HTTP 500，随后以Exit Code 78主动退出 → Kubelet检测到容器异常退出并触发BackOff策略 → Pod状态进入CrashLoopBackOff，持续重启失败\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为 Pod 内的 `app` 容器在启动阶段检测到关键配置项缺失，主动抛出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误并返回 HTTP 500，随后以退出码 78 终止进程，导致 Kubernetes 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。该结论得到 K8s 退出码、日志错误模式和 Tracing 观测模式的三方印证（证据2、3、4）。由于缺失的具体配置项名称未在观测中捕获，其详细参数构成未知的局限性（unknowns）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 69.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 69.0s (Evidence 58.5s, RCA 10.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 95.142, "metrics": {"run_id": "dcca0d8e7b434c50", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 95.14969563484192, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 95149.69563484192, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 76348.8519191742, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 40492.913484573364, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 18396.050453186035}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16667.852640151978, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 69006.16002082825, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9454.79679107666, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

